  "releaseNotes": "⭐ Last 10 features:\n- [codex] add vendor extension compatibility layer (#252) 2026-04-09\n- feat(http): surface callbacks webhooks and links (#250) 2026-04-09\n- feat(cli): expand gRPC scaffolding workflows (#249) 2026-04-09\n- feat: add configurable csharp identifier character sets (#244) 2026-04-08\n- feat: complete oauth2 support for generated clients 2026-04-06\n- feat: scaffold grpc client projects from proto 2026-04-03\n- feat: support system.net.http.json generation 2026-04-02\n- feat: generate data annotations validation 2026-04-02\n- feat: expose success response headers via wrappers 2026-04-02\n- feat(docs): scaffold shared mkdocs theme and workflow 2026-04-01\n🐞 Last 10 bug fixes:\n- [codex] add vendor extension compatibility layer (#252) 2026-04-09\n- fix: restore shared helper emission 2026-04-08\n- fix: support two-project source generation 2026-04-08\n- test: fix allof trim assertion 2026-04-06\n- fix: clone oauth2 requests without missing polyfills 2026-04-06\n- fix: sanitize generated authorization helpers 2026-04-06\n- fix: restore trim-safe serializer context for huge unions 2026-04-06\n- fix: support CPM restore for source generators (#222) 2026-04-04\n- fix: repair system.net.http.json snapshot compatibility 2026-04-03\n- fix: reject grpc proto inputs in openapi loader 2026-04-02",
